  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Facility for Disaster Reduction and Recovery: Pacific-led disaster and climate resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is a contribution to the Multi-Donor Trust Fund (MDTF) of the Global Facility for Disaster Reduction and Recovery (GFDRR) &#x2013; a global partnership within the World Bank Group. The investment is earmarked to the Pacific region to support disaster and climate resilience in line with the Sendai Framework for Disaster Risk Reduction 2015-2030. Expected outcomes include the provision of technical assistance to help strengthen Pacific Government capacities for risk-informed development; to mainstream disaster risk management (DRM); to financially prepare for disasters and climate shocks; to enhance disaster preparedness and resilient recovery; and to promote gender responsive and inclusive DRM.</narrative>
  </description>
